"89958","synopsis":"一室和两室的人联合起来去沙漠的遗迹营救考古队和救援队。沈辣在晚上看见一头山羊，孙德胜便跟了过去。两人陷进了流沙遇到了一个小孩的灵魂。小孩对二人发起了攻击，白露出现打跑了小孩的灵魂。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/b25Sn9YtQvBjB78yfFSSYu0Diws.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15683","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"110699","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"41917","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"94199","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"388678","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"89959","synopsis":"沈辣、孙德胜和白露进入古雉国百节王的陵墓，沈辣用吴仁荻的剑割开定尸铜棺。孙德胜乱碰掉进百节王真正的墓，从墙上的壁画得知定尸铜棺中的人与百节王的关系，在看壁画过程中沈辣中了梦魇。一小时后六室主任吴仁荻在百节王的陵墓中出现。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4IGb9vknSEyCF6VZ12rdNnJr6vM.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15683","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"110699","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"41917","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"94199","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"388678","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"89960","synopsis":"吴仁荻进入沈辣的幻境救出了他，沈辣按照幻境中的路让四人中了第二个幻境。在第二幻境中选错了路中了第三个幻境。在第三幻境中吴仁荻控制住小孩的灵魂解救了考古队和民调局的人。在返回民调局的路中杨枭混进了里面……","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/AuKhwamp45x2SDW6iq5wWkZAqxH.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15683","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"110699","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"41917","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"94199","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"388678","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"89962","synopsis":"回到局里欧阳偏左给沈辣和孙德胜检测身体，沈辣的情况被丘不老知道后把沈辣抓走。高亮要求丘不老放掉沈辣并答应让他监督沈辣转正考核。白露特训沈辣和孙德胜两个月后在刘家村完成考核，丘不老要除掉沈辣被高亮阻止。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pG6qjFBvlguOFhzGWGrK3vuLPHY.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15683","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"110699","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"41917","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"94199","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"388678","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"89964","synopsis":"傀儡抢夺沈辣身上“林火异能”，沈辣、吴仁荻、孙德胜三人入盗梦空间，多层梦境显胖子睿智。昏迷事件调查原因竟是中了古巫术蛊毒，小杨教主身份逐渐展开。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cNLzl96yzRYgMi9b6Ozuc8te2M7.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15683","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"110699","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"41917","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"94199","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"388678","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"89963","synopsis":"昏迷者中爞毒，身上缠悬印。教主杨枭为救妻子变装露真身，小分队荒楼斗傀儡，吴仁荻加入抢夺圣物地珠。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/y9eoADqWUP35Yq3Q7MKRl1YahYH.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15683","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"110699","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"41917","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"94199","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"388678","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"89966","synopsis":"陆云设圈套争上位，杨枭救妻心切夺地珠，被迫与吴仁荻交手身负重伤。吴仁荻出手救蓉蓉，一段跨越千年的恩怨，即将了结。"